{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國消費者權益組織「停止計劃報廢計劃」（Halte à l』Obsolescence Programmée，簡稱HOP）針對蘋果公司的投訴取得新進展。經過數年的調查後，法國檢方決定將蘋果公司訴至巴黎刑事法院，案件圍繞所謂「計劃報廢」以及限制設備維修的問題展開。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586812.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:37:33.459193+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:20:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:39.304258+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:39.304258+00:00","content_hash":"fb32faa505bd1bd9aee8d833cd61ca89c34756a3c283f1def57f3c7f35809c03","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}